<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: arachna core -->
  <OE_ArachnaCore.label>蛛后核心</OE_ArachnaCore.label>
  <!-- EN: A hyper-advanced computer core containing the AI persona of the Arachne Queen. It's unknown how the Crimson Arachna Cult got it, but with proper tuning it has huge potential. -->
  <OE_ArachnaCore.description>包含蛛后AI人格的超先进计算机核心。猩红蛛族教派是如何获得它的尚不清楚，但经过适当调校后具有巨大潜力。</OE_ArachnaCore.description>
  <!-- EN: Analyze the arachna core. -->
  <OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateDescString>分析蛛后核心。</OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateDescString>
  <!-- EN: Analyze... -->
  <OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateLabelString>分析...</OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.activateLabelString>
  <!-- EN: By studying the Arachna Core, {PAWN_labelShort} has acquired the insight needed for the research project(s) {RESEARCH}.\n\nYour researchers can now use research benches to begin researching how to actually use the technology. -->
  <OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetter>通过研究蛛后核心，{PAWN_labelShort}获得了研究项目{RESEARCH}所需的知识。\n\n您的研究人员现在可以使用研究台开始研究如何实际使用这项技术。</OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetter>
  <!-- EN: Arachna Core studied: {RESEARCH} unlocked -->
  <OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetterLabel>蛛后核心已研究：{RESEARCH}已解锁</OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.completedLetterLabel>
  <!-- EN: Choose who should analyze this -->
  <OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.guiLabelString>选择谁应该分析这个</OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.guiLabelString>
  <!-- EN: Can be analyzed by a colonist. -->
  <OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.inspectString>可由殖民者分析。</OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Analyze arachna core -->
  <OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.jobString>分析蛛后核心</OE_ArachnaCore.comps.CompAnalyzableUnlockResearch.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: mutated EGO seed – Elder Direwolf -->
  <OE_EGOSeed_Elder_Direwolf.label>变异的EGO种子 - 年长恐狼</OE_EGOSeed_Elder_Direwolf.label>
  <!-- EN: Once the seed of an EGO tree, this specimen mutated under unknown conditions after entering the body of an Elder Direwolf. It sprouted within the host, forming an amalgam symbiosis. It can no longer be used to grow an EGO tree. -->
  <OE_EGOSeed_Elder_Direwolf.description>曾经是EGO树的种子，这个标本在进入年长恐狼体内后在未知条件下发生变异。它在宿主体内发芽，形成了融合共生体。不能再用于种植EGO树。</OE_EGOSeed_Elder_Direwolf.description>
  
